      {
        "id": 194164,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-13T13:35:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"ogseamus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ogseamus/48/4830_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ogseamus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I unfortunately cannot figure out the infinite loop part. I was following everything until it gets to that part.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Every time Guise regains 1 HP, 3 targets regain 1 HP, every time Scholar regains HP he deals 3 targets 1 damage.</p>\n<p>As long as Guise uses every third heal on himself he can go on until he reaches max HP. As long as for each time Guise heals himself Scholar targets Guise and each time Scholar heals he damage himself neither will ever reach max HP and the loop can continue.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:21:16.518Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
