        "created_at": "2017-04-13T13:44:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That said, Guise has to gain more than 1 HP, otherwise Scholar won't be doing enough damage to get through Akash'bhuta's damage reduction. &nbsp;Which is why we needed Selling Out and Look What I Found rather than relying on the damage from Guise's main power.</p>",
