        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-14T14:27:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>OK, so the Scholar plays Keep Moving three times, putting all three copies of Mortal Form to Energy in play.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What was the 4th card played?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it was Solid to Liquid, wouldn't that be enough to increase his damage enough to break through the DR?</p>",
